      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "title": "One question is enough",
        "body": "Use the prompt below after the handshake. Replace the workshop topic with a decision, research question, or small project of your own.\n\n## Use the current instructions\n\nThe gold **Twilite** button on the right of the address bar supplies the starting prompt.\n\nAsk your AI to read:\n\n- Twilite onboarding (https://twilite.zone/library/documentation/contracts/onboarding.md)\n- Current node composition (https://twilite.zone/library/documentation/contracts/nodes/graph-native-node-composition.md)\n\nIf it cannot open those documents, provide their text before continuing.\n\nThe first reply should be one small additive JSON transaction. Copy the JSON and paste it into your new graph. Check the result before requesting more.\n\nFor your saved graph, ask for the current declaration, its views, glyph, and landing surface. Content belongs in Content nodes. A named Port is needed only when you want to expose an additional connection endpoint.\n\n## Give your work a starting shape\n\nAfter the handshake, copy this prompt into your AI chat:\n\n```text\nHelp me plan a small workshop in Twilite.\nFollow the current Graph-Native Node Composition contract.\nCreate a small graph with a question, venue notes, a decision,\nand a next step. Label the relationships so I can follow the\nreasoning. Use clearly marked fictional notes for this example.\nInclude the declaration, default/summary/icon views, glyph,\nand landing surface required by the current contract.\nUse Content nodes for the material. Do not add a separate root\nPort. Return one additive JSON transaction for my new graph.\n```\n\nReplace the workshop with your own topic when you are ready.",
        "presentation": {
          "glyph": {
            "kind": "icon",
            "name": "Article"
          },
          "baseLevel": "detail"
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "tutorial-bootstrap-llm"
        },
        "classRef": "tlz://twilite.zone/library/templates/page-template/classes/page-section.node-class.node"
      }
    },
